    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "30600",
            "objective": "Meet Amber at the temple",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30601",
            "objective": "Talk to Amber",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3061101",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "This is it. One of the deserted <color=#00E1FFFF>temples of The Four Winds</color>."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061102",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "These temples have been left to waste for years now. The people of Mondstadt almost never come here."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061103",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "There's a chance there's a monster nest or a hilichurl camp inside."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061104",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Even Stormterror has given up on its own temple.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "3061105",
                            "text": "\"Stormterror...\"?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3061107",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "...Yes."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061108",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I also find it hard to accept, but... Stormterror was once one of The Four Winds."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061109",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Ehhhh!?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061110",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "Wait... Did you just feel that?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061111",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "The wind here... Something's off..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061112",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "#Let's go in and take a look, {NICKNAME}. Be careful, the dragon's power is disturbing this area."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "3061106",
                            "text": "Wait, did you just say \"its own temple...\"?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30602",
            "objective": "Enter the temple",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30612",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3061201",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Everyone in Mondstadt is still getting blown about by the storm..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061202",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Every second we waste is a mark against the name of Favonius. Let's get in that temple, stat!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30603",
            "objective": "Explore the temple's depths",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30610",
            "objective": "Talk to Amber",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3061001",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "Phew, I'm tired."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061002",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "But, at least this way we've helped Jean out."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061003",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "In the past, we were at least able to defend the city and keep it safe."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061004",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "This, of course, is mostly thanks to Jean."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061005",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "But now with Stormterror directly attacking the city itself..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3061006",
                    "speaker": "Amber",
                    "text": "\"The winds change, so too should our tactics.\"",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "3061007",
                            "text": "Sounds deep.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3061009",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "It's what Lisa likes to say."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061010",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "Speaking of which, The Four Winds we were discussing earlier..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061011",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "If you want to learn more about our history, you can ask Lisa."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061012",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "...I'm not saying I don't know our history! It's just..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3061013",
                                    "speaker": "Amber",
                                    "text": "I mean... A librarian is supposed to be more knowledgeable than an Outrider, right?"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "3061008",
                            "text": "Did you come up with it?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30604",
            "objective": "Leave Domain",
            "dialogues": []
        }
    ]
